": ""}]}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "id": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}]}], "type": "RSLT", "id": 11, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le13ob10re2img06.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le13ob10re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le13ob10re2img06.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn9le13ob10re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Hi Joe!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Joe</span>:  Hi Adam, how's it going?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Not bad, I'm still job hunting. Next week, I will be going to an interview for a freelance journalist position. I will have been to four different interviews in two weeks, but no luck so far. How about you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Joe</span>:  Same. I have another interview next week. I hope it goes better than the last one. What an ordeal. It was a nightmare interview!<br>", "id": 1}, {"time": "22300", "image": "engenn9le13ob10re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Why? What happened?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Joe</span>: The interview was for a job in marketing in the airline industry. The interview was scheduled for 14:00, which in international time is 2:00 p.m. I was running late so I was very rushed. I ended up wearing two different shoes. I didn't comb my hair or iron my shirt.  <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Oh, man.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Joe</span>:  It only gets worse.  I arrived just on time, or what I thought was just on time.  It turns out the recruiter made a mistake. He said the thought the interview was scheduled for 4:00 p.m. He said the president wasn't free until then, so I had to wait 2 hours.  <br>", "id": 2}, {"time": "56300", "image": "engenn9le13ob10re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Oh, that's too bad.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Joe</span>: That's not all. Then, during the interview, the COO asked me a lot of unusual questions I wasn't prepared for. He asked me what my greatest weakness was. I'll have to think of a good answer for that one for the future. Then he asked me why the references I gave them had incorrect phone numbers. That didn't look very good.  He also asked me what I thought about the company mission statement, which I didn't know. I'm going to make sure I do a lot more research before my next interview. I'll read everything I can find on the company website.  I'll think about answers to those tough questions!  And I'm updating the phone numbers of my references tonight!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I'm going to do the same thing. <br>", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "p", "value": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  How did your interview go yesterday?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sandra</span>:  It was quite an ordeal. It was a nightmare, actually.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  Why?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sandra</span>: The job description was for a job in the airline industry, but really they just wanted someone in sales.  I hate sales. How was your interview?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  I didn't have it yet. It is scheduled for tomorrow.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sandra</span>:  Good luck!"}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 2, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}